Common Mistakes to Avoid
❌ Forgetting to subtract common events in OR rule
❌ Not simplifying the final fraction
❌ Confusing "at least 1" with "exactly 1"
❌ Wrong total sample space (especially cards and dice)
❌ Not checking if events are independent before multiplying


